  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0 (2024-12-24)\n\n - Added a default font field to UiStyle.\n - Exception in TextDynamicComponent for drawing it without a font/default font.\n - DoAutoDraw and DoAutoUpdate is set to true by default on UiDynamicComponent.\n - ClickableEventComponent uses fields instead of EventHandlers.\n - TextButton element.\n - TextLabel element.\n - Changed Vector2Int.Contains to Vector2Int.DoesOffsetContain.\n - Vector2Int.DoesOffsetContain does not round anymore (idk why it did before).",
